  "text": {
    "title": "Gullet of Dunes",
    "body": "Deep in the sand-choked crypts lies the Gullet of Dunes. Gorrathul, the Sand Glutton, rules this subterranean pit with a freezing chill. Slay the colossus to break the desert scourge.",
    "obj.0": "Slay Gorrathul, the Sand Glutton in the Gullet of Dunes",
    "msg.1": "A freezing mist rises from the sand. Gorrathul can burrow underground to crush you from below!",
