    "msg.2": "Gorrathul has collapsed into the dust! The desert depths are reclaimed.",
    "win": "Gorrathul, the Sand Glutton is defeated. The subterranean terror is no more.",
    "fail.1": "Your hero was crushed in the Gullet of Dunes."
